        <mxCell id="qdohbViG0SO-9dYkMyN0-22" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;References&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/symphony&quot;&gt;openai/symphony: Symphony turns project work into isolated, autonomous implementation runs, allowing teams to manage work instead of supervising coding agents.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://martinfowler.com/articles/harness-engineering.html&quot;&gt;Harness engineering for coding agent users&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://martinfowler.com/articles/exploring-gen-ai/sdd-3-tools.html&quot;&gt;Understanding Spec-Driven-Development: Kiro, spec-kit, and Tessl&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI benchmarks with scaffolding is usually higher than without (duh)&lt;br&gt;Sqlite test suite aka spec is closed source, while the code is oss. That means the value of spec IS the software itself&lt;br&gt;Huge CLAUDE.md file some practices to learn from&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/coleam00/Archon/blob/dev/CLAUDE.md&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Archon/CLAUDE.md at dev · coleam00/Archon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
